# Parity matrix rules. First matching rule wins; a pattern ends in `*` for a prefix match.
# Columns: pattern|status|slice|rust location(s) (relative to src/pierre_diffs, `;` separated)|note
# status: PORTED (Rust exists and is tested), PENDING (in scope, later slice), OUT (never), DEFER (maybe later).
# Regenerate PARITY.md and parity/matrix.psv with `node oracle/parity.mjs`; CI-style check: `node oracle/parity.mjs --check`.
highlights/dist/highlighter.js|PORTED|S7|highlights/highlighter.rs|langIdOf, isSupportedLanguage, codeToTokens over a `HighlightRecords` source (the wasm stays unmodified behind it); instance/memory management, HTML modes, StreamTokenizer and ansi not ported
