pierre/src/components/File.ts|DEFER|-||single-file view deferred; review loop uses FileDiff
pierre/src/components/FileDiff.ts|PORTED|S12a|components/file_diff.rs|PARTIAL. S12a-1 (the options seam): `FileDiffOptions` (callbacks compared by `Rc` identity), `getTheme`, the interaction wiring rule and `interaction_options`, `canPartiallyRender`, `shouldApplyColumnVariables`, `getLineIndexForDiff`, oracle-tested against the published class constructed without a DOM. S12a-2a (the struct and its first lifecycle seam): constructor wiring over `FileDiffHost`, `setOptions`, `syncInteractionOptions`, `setThemeType`/`applyCachedThemeState`/`hasThemeChanged`, annotations, selection deferral, `flushManagers`, `getLineIndex`, `handleExpandHunk`; oracle-tested over a fake DOM (251 scenarios incl. seeded random sequences). S12a-2b (render and hydration over the `Document`, views under `components/file_diff/`): `render` and its orchestration, `hydrate`/`hydrateElements`/`hydrationSetup`, `loadFilesIfNecessary` and the host-driven `files_loaded`/`abandon_file_load`, `updateInputDiff`, `adoptRenderData`, `emitPostRender`, `rerender`, the shell (`getOrCreateFileContainer`, sprite, pre, header and header slots, separators, annotations, gutter utility, buffers), theme and unsafe CSS (`applyThemeState`, `injectUnsafeCSS`), the code columns, partial render and row trimming; oracle-tested against the published class over jsdom 26.1.0 (handwritten and seeded random scenarios, `s12b_render.json`). S12a-2c: `cleanUp` (managers first, then every node the instance created, never the container) and `isLineRenderable`/`getNearestRenderableLine`/`revealLine` (the `Lines` view), oracle-tested over jsdom (cleanUp, queries, reveal and expandHunk steps; 374 scenarios) and a churn test; edit-session, worker and merge-conflict code is dropped
pierre/src/components/FileStream.ts|PENDING|S10-S12||PORT as Dioxus components (semantics, not code shape)
pierre/src/components/UnresolvedFile.ts|DEFER|-||DEFER (not needed for PR review v1)
pierre/src/components/VirtualizedFile.ts|DEFER|-||single-file view deferred; review loop uses FileDiff
pierre/src/components/VirtualizedFileDiff.ts|PORTED|S12b|components/virtualized_file_diff/layout.rs;components/virtualized_file_diff/window.rs;components/virtualized_file_diff/instance.rs;components/virtualized_file_diff/overrides.rs|PORTED (S12b-1, S12b-2 and S12b-3), split in three: S12b-1 the layout model (`DiffLayout`, `LayoutContext`, the cache, estimated heights, layout checkpoints and their searches, line counts, cache resets, the option-change predicates and the free helpers at the end of the file), pure over `FileDiffMetadata` and the options, oracle-tested against the published class's layout methods (s12b_layout.json: handwritten and seeded random sequences over a pool of diffs); S12b-2 the window and measurement (`window.rs`: `computeRenderRangeFromWindow`, `getLinePosition`; `instance.rs`: `VirtualizedFileDiff` with `reconcileHeights` and `measureFileAnnotationHeight`, `onRender`, `setVisibility`, `syncVirtualizedTop`, `updatePendingRender`, `syncLineAnnotations`, `updateCodeViewLayout`), oracle-tested against the published class over a declared DOM (s12b_window.json: handwritten window sweeps and measurement sequences and 300 seeded random sequences; the window half and the DOM reads are compared at every step); S12b-3 the FileDiff integration (`overrides.rs`: the constructor over `FileDiff`, `OverrideHooks` (the `FileDiffHooks` for `finalizeRender`, `expandHunk`, `handleFilesLoaded`, `setLineAnnotations` and the tail of `flushManagers`), `render`, `rerender`, `setOptions`, `setLineAnnotations`, `cleanUp`, `expandHunk`, `finalizeRender`, and the `SubscribedInstance` the virtualizer drives: `onRender`, `reconcileHeights`, `setVisibility`), verified by the upstream tests in `integration_upstream_tests.rs` and the churn test through a connected instance; and the differential oracle `s12b_virtualized.json` (the published `VirtualizedFileDiff` connected to the published `Virtualizer` over jsdom in a scripted world of declared geometry, scroll, resize, observer deliveries and frames: 24 handwritten and 120 seeded random scenarios, every step's value, host trace, instance and virtualizer state and container trees compared, replayed in components/file_diff_render_oracle_tests/virtualized.rs). CodeView mode, ghost text rows and edit-session hooks are dropped (dropped.psv)
pierre/src/components/Virtualizer.ts|PORTED|S10|components/virtualizer.rs|logic mirrors the class statement for statement against a `VirtualizerHost` trait (components/virtualizer.rs, oracle-tested against the published class under a scripted fake DOM); the platform host (geometry, events, observers) is the Dioxus-events host to come in pierre_diffs_dioxus (the S10 web-sys `WebHost` was removed in S12a-2). Dev hooks (`__STOP`, `__INSTANCE`, `__TOGGLE`) not ported Divergences: `scrollFix`'s element write is the host method `element_scroll_by` (default: upstream's read-then-write; the Dioxus host reads the offset asynchronously and scrolls by the delta in one task: parity/divergences.psv); the anchor line queries search the file element's shadow root as upstream does (`fileElement.shadowRoot?.querySelectorAll`), falling back to the element itself for the scripted worlds that declare no shadow root (the port searched the element's own children, which finds nothing under a real `FileDiff` render).
