pierre/test/virtualizedFileDiffEstimatedHeights.test.ts|PENDING|S12b||PARTIAL (components/virtualized_file_diff/layout_upstream_tests.rs, window_upstream_tests.rs). 5 (S12b-1) + 18 (S12b-2) + 2 (S12b-3, integration_upstream_tests.rs) of the file's 27 VirtualizedFileDiff cases ported with their names. S12b-2 ported the `getLinePosition` cases (paired estimates across style, collapse and expansion changes, `checkpoint generation jumps through large uniform blocks`, `builds layout checkpoints lazily for deep geometry lookups`), `applies measured height deltas without replaying full diff layout`, the file-level annotation measurement cases (`applies measured file-level annotation height`, `ignores first-row annotation keys...`, `preserves...`, `clears...`, `retains removed ... until the top renders`) and the `computeRenderRangeFromWindow` cases (the eight render-range cases and `does not reserve unmeasured file-level annotations above diff source rows`). S12b-3 ported `retains file-level annotation height through recycling until the top remounts` (`cleanUp(true)`) and `ignores trailing fromEnd expansion in render range line totals` (`render` and `expandHunk` on the instance). Pending: `render range clamp reaches additionLines.length after stale layout cache` (needs `recomputeDiffHunks`, the edit-time hunk recompute, not ported: the stale layout cache the test builds is made by an edit session, so nothing in the port that remains can produce it); `builds layout checkpoints lazily for deep render windows` drives CodeView's `getAdvancedStickySpecs` (dropped)
